2</classification-symbol><classification-symbol scheme="ICO">T04N5:57</classification-symbol><classification-symbol scheme="ICO">T04N5:74M4C</classification-symbol> </classification-ecla><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="EN">IMAGE DISPLAYING APPARATUS AND METHOD, AND IMAGE PROCESSING DEVICE AND METHOD</invention-title><invention-title load-source="docdb"  status="new" lang="FR">APPAREIL ET PROCEDE D'AFFICHAGE D'IMAGE, ET DISPOSITIF ET PROCEDE DE TRAITEMENT D'IMAGE</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="EP-0467373-A2" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>EP</country><doc-number>0467373</doc-number> <kind>A2</kind> </document-id> <sources><source category="A" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-5075899-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>5075899</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-59061283-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>59061283</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1117088A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI KESATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI, KESATOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI KESATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKEUCHI, KESATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A specific adjustment of the quality of image is carried out according to the setting made by the user. Irrespective of the preset value of the adjustment of the quality of image, the contrast is compensated maintaining the luminance at the central part of an area of a specific color larger than a predetermined size at an approximately constant value. The quality of image is adjusted by selecting one of filters having different frequency characteristics according to the preset value of sharpness adjustment and carrying out a filtering processing of the image by using the selected filter. The contrast of the image after the filtering processing is compensated by using a contrast compensation value correlated with the selected filter in advance.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un réglage spécifique de la qualité d'image effectué selon l'installation faite par l'utilisateur. Quelle que soit la valeur préétablie du réglage de la qualité d'image, le contraste est compensé, maintenant la luminance dans la partie centrale d'une zone de couleur spécifique plus grande qu'une dimension prédéterminée à une valeur approximativement constante. La qualité d'image est réglée par le choix d'un filtre ayant des caractéristiques de fréquence différentes en fonction de la valeur préétablie du réglage la netteté et de la mise en oeuvre du processus de filtrage de l'image à l'aide du filtre choisi. Le contraste de l'image, après filtrage, est compensé par une valeur de compensation de contraste corrélée au préalable avec le filtre choisi.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>